/E (My journey at 180 Degrees Consulting VNIT has been one of the most enriching experiences of my college life. I had known about 180DC since my JEE preparation days, so joining the VNIT chapter in my second year was exciting and fulfilling. Through consulting projects, case competitions, and industry exposure, I developed strong problem-solving, communication, and business understanding skills, which also helped me secure a valuable internship.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
