452 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 358 0 R
/E (Serving as an Advisory member at 180 Degrees Consulting VNIT has been an incredibly rewarding experience. The core team carried forward the foundation we built and elevated it further by introducing impactful projects, organizing new events, and spreading awareness about consulting and product management within the institute. Their dedication, leadership, and ability to innovate truly stood out.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 358 0 R
