469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 359 0 R
/E (Joining 180 Degrees Consulting during my second year at our college felt like absolute perfect timing. Being selected as part of their very first cohort of consultants was a unique privilege that set the stage for immense growth. Looking back, the rigorous strategies we passionately brainstormed together laid a remarkably solid foundation. That analytical framework consistently supported me through the demanding coursework and challenges of the rest of my graduation. Evolving into a Consulting Director was a deeply formative and transformative experience. It did not just build a line on my resume; it fundamentally shaped who I am today. The role taught me the delicate nuances of truly connecting meaningfully with diverse groups of people and leading teams. More than anything, the invaluable lessons, mentorship, and practical experiences from 180DC gave me the absolute courage, clarity, and unwavering conviction to successfully launch and run my own venture today.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
