/Title (Escape Room, the flagship product hackathon organized by 180 Degrees Consulting VNIT Nagpur, brought together 100+ participants from diverse institutions to solve real world innovation challenges through a fast-paced, multi-round competition. The event featured three intensive stages - a guesstimate round testing analytical thinking, a case problem round focused on strategic problem solving, and a final prototype building round where teams transformed ideas into practical product solutions. Participants showcased creativity, innovation, and execution skills, making Escape Room a dynamic platform for aspiring product thinkers and builders.)
